    "experience_reward": 10, "behavior": "kite_shoot", "color": [230, 120, 60],
    "tags": ["exploder", "ranged"], "sprite": "bomb_fish", "contact_damage_enabled": false,
    "_bomb_comment": "It throws its bomb now instead of being one (owner, 2026-09-17). The art was always a fish LOBBING a bomb -- `shoot.png` has been wired as its `attack` strip since it shipped, and `exploder` never enters a telegraph/attack state, so those 7 frames had never once played. `shot_stop_after` halts the bomb mid-flight so the `bomb` rig swaps from `spin` to its lit `fuse`, then `shot_lifetime` runs out and `shot_blast_radius` detonates it on the player's side of the fight. `shot_tint` is HOSTILE_ARROW_TINT, the same red the hostile arrow wears, so an incoming bomb reads as incoming. `explode_radius` / `explode_damage` stay: they are the corpse blast the cull pass makes when it dies, which is still true of a fish full of bombs.",
    "prefer_distance": 210, "shoot_interval": 2.8, "shoot_damage": 18,
    "shot_speed": 200, "shot_radius": 9,
    "shot_style": "bomb", "shot_tint": [150, 26, 12],
